       )
       |TYPE_(
             GEOMETRY
             |((MEDIUM|LONG|TINY)_)?BLOB
             |BIT|JSON|SHORT|STRING|SET|YEAR|NULL|NEWDECIMAL|NEWDATE|CHAR
             |TIME(STAMP)?
